+ Things Need to Prepared For This Lab
  - VMware workstation or Oracle Virtualbox
  - pfsense ISO file
  - Ubuntu Server
  - Windows Client
+ pfsense on vm requirement
  - Ram 2gb
  - storage 60gb
  - core 2
  - At least 4-5 Networks Adapter
+ Ubuntu Server on vm requirement
  - Ram 2gb
  - storage 128gb
  - core 2
+ Window Client on vm requirement
  - Ram 2gb
  - Storage 128gb
  - core 2
( Note : this is for window 8.1 as for other version of windows u can use what vm recommand for you or configure your own self!)
